{"id":395,"slug":"395-path-aliases-trong-typescript-paths-config-la-gi","category":"TypeScript","subcategory":"Chuyên Sâu","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Path aliases trong TypeScript (paths config) là gì?","question_en":"What are path aliases in TypeScript (paths config)?","answer_vi":"paths trong tsconfig.json map import paths để tránh relative paths dài. Cần configure cả bundler vì TS compiler chỉ handle types, không transform imports.\n\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{ \"compilerOptions\": { \"paths\": { \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"] } } }\n```\n\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite';\nexport default defineConfig({\n  resolve: { alias: { '@': '/src' } }\n});\n// Dùng: import { Button } from '@/components/Button'\n```","answer_en":"paths in tsconfig.json maps import paths to avoid long relative paths. Requires configuring both TS and the bundler because the TS compiler only handles types and does not transform imports.\n\n```json\n// tsconfig.json\n{ \"compilerOptions\": { \"paths\": { \"@/*\": [\"./src/*\"] } } }\n```\n\n```typescript\n// vite.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite';\nexport default defineConfig({\n  resolve: { alias: { '@': '/src' } }\n});\n// Usage: import { Button } from '@/components/Button'\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">paths trong tsconfig.json map import paths để tránh relative paths dài.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Cần configure cả bundler vì TS compiler chỉ handle types, không transform imports.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// tsconfig.json\n{ &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: { &quot;paths&quot;: { &quot;@/*&quot;: [&quot;./src/*&quot;] } } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// tsconfig.json</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;compilerOptions&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;paths&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">&quot;@/*&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;./src/*&quot;</span><span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"hljs-punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// vite.config.ts\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite';\nexport default defineConfig({\n  resolve: { alias: { '@': '/src' } }\n});\n// Dùng: import { Button } from '@/components/Button'\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// vite.config.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { defineConfig } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vite&#x27;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">defineConfig</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">resolve</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">alias</span>: { <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/src&#x27;</span> } }\n});\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Dùng: import { Button } from &#x27;@/components/Button&#x27;</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">paths in tsconfig.json maps import paths to avoid long relative paths.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Requires configuring both TS and the bundler because the TS compiler only handles types and does not transform imports.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// tsconfig.json\n{ &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: { &quot;paths&quot;: { &quot;@/*&quot;: [&quot;./src/*&quot;] } } }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a